Raddy

Caddy (https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy), by Matthew Holt and the Caddy Authors,
is a behavioral reference for Raddy's Caddyfile adapter and HTTP routing. Caddy is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Cloudflare DNS provider for Caddy (https://github.com/caddy-dns/cloudflare)
is a reference for Cloudflare token configuration. Raddy has its own Rust
implementation; it does not load or bundle Caddy modules. Raddy is not affiliated
with the Caddy project.
